# 09b round-10 distinguishing ablations of clean payload C10

Payload C10: d1fcffdf8b3f411ecde28ae0b14fe79523dfcc14.
Each ablation changes exactly one behaviour in a detached worktree at C10, runs
packages/kernel/tests/*.test.ts against it, and is reverted before the next.
An ablation is REJECTED when named packet cases fail; that is what makes those cases
distinguishing rather than merely green.

XA/XB are new for K11-R7-STATE-03 (this round's finding). X1/X7/X3/X4/X8 re-prove the
own-data family guards after the descriptor-hardening reconstruction.
Guards for code this round does not touch (holey scratch X2, dual serializer layers X5,
frozen vocabulary X6, Map/freeze S1/S2, primordial prototype V3, exact-JCS-call N1, single
bound observation N3, descriptor agreement P1, JCS pin JCS, over-limit traversal) are
unchanged between C9 and C10 apart from the descriptor they convert through; their
round-9 runs (validation-09/09b) remain committed as their own round's evidence and are
not claimed as this candidate's reruns.

=== control: unmodified C10 ===
    207 tests, 0 failing -> control clean

=== ablation [XA]: defineData builds an ordinary descriptor literal (install direction only) ===
packages/kernel/src/own-array.ts | 11 +----------
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 10 deletions(-)
    207 tests, 11 failing -> REJECTED by 11 case(s):
      - a payload observation that installs get/set still creates the exact Execution
      - an ordinary handler broken by its own pollution is refused, never accepted or leaked
      - a bound getter that installs Object.prototype.get still reserves the exact prefix
      - an installed Object.prototype.set cannot shorten a larger batch, and redelivery keeps it
      - an inherited descriptor getter runs zero times inside the hardened operation
      - descriptor pollution and an inherited indexed trap together still commit the exact batch
      - a payload observation that installs get/set still retains the accepted Event
      - inspect, redelivery and listings under live get/set pollution equal the unpolluted views
      - every hostile data-field combination still yields the exact clean bytes
      - an inherited descriptor getter never runs inside capture, cloning or the serializer window
      - an own __proto__ member still installs while conversion is hostile

=== ablation [XB]: restoreDescriptor passes the saved ordinary descriptor through (restore direction only) ===
packages/kernel/src/own-array.ts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)
    207 tests, 6 failing -> REJECTED by 6 case(s):
      - a payload observation that installs get/set still creates the exact Execution
      - a payload observation that installs get/set still retains the accepted Event
      - every hostile data-field combination still yields the exact clean bytes
      - an inherited descriptor getter never runs inside capture, cloning or the serializer window
